## Notes

- Topics are a loose week-by-week outline and may shift slightly in delivery; assignment due dates above are fixed.
- Multi-step labs (e.g., Web Hosting, RAID/Data Management, Identity/LDAP) are often due one to two weeks after the topic is first introduced, once build/configuration time is accounted for — due dates reflect this build time, not a change in topic.
- The dotfiles project (Tasks 1–4 and Peer Review) runs in parallel across the whole semester rather than in a single dedicated week.
- All assignments are due 11:59 PM on the listed date unless otherwise noted (Self-Hosted Application and the Final Exam block have specific times above).

